[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0457","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0457.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0572","title":"Visible Systems Razor 密码文件弱加密漏洞","description":"Visible Systems Razor 4.1 配置管理工具使用弱加密算法（仅对密码字节进行循环右移2位）存储密码文件，本地攻击者可利用该弱点解密密码文件，从而获取提升后的系统权限。此漏洞需本地访问权限，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0572"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-05","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"Razor 厂商官方声明（2007年）：在维护期内的用户可免费升级至使用更强加密算法的新版本；Razor 4.1 及以上版本可切换为本地操作系统认证替代 Razor 内置认证方式；通过文件系统权限（如 chmod 600）限制密码文件仅允许管理员读取；考虑迁移至其他仍在维护的配置管理工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1424","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-07-8&msg=613309F30B6DD2118C020000F809376C05CABD49%40emss03m09.orl.lmco.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20058"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0457.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0473","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0473.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0594","title":"BitchX IRC Client 格式化字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BitchX IRC 客户端在处理邀请（INVITE）消息时未对不可信的格式字符串进行适当清理。远程攻击者可构造包含特殊格式化字符的频道名称，通过发送恶意 INVITE 消息触发拒绝服务漏洞，导致目标客户端崩溃或无法正常响应。该漏洞影响 BitchX IRC Client 1.0c16 及之前版本，攻击无需身份认证，利用门槛低，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0594"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04.317","remediation":"升级 BitchX IRC Client 至 1.0c17 或更高版本（已修复格式字符串漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可在 IRC 服务器端配置拦截包含格式化字符（如 %n、%s、%x 等）的频道名邀请，或在客户端禁用自动接受邀请功能（/SET AUTO_INVITE OFF）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0026.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0098.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0105.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-07/0042.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q3/0018.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-022.0.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-042.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1436","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4897","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20060","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0594.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0594","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0594.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0594.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gghx-4gcj-rpw8/GHSA-gghx-4gcj-rpw8.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0594.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0594.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0473.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0469","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0469.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0590","title":"CGI-World Poll It 2.0 内部变量覆盖导致任意文件读取漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0590是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0590"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-04T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03.820","remediation":"立即删除或卸载服务器上 CGI-World Poll It 2.0 CGI 脚本（pollit/Poll_It_SSI_v2.0.cgi），该软件已停止维护多年且此远程文件读取漏洞无官方补丁。若业务短期内无法移除，应在 Web 服务器配置中通过 IP 白名单或 HTTP 基本认证严格限制脚本访问权限，仅允许可信内网地址访问，并尽快替换为当前受支持且经过安全审计的在线调查工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0076.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1431","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4878","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20059","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/af9951ed676bcfbcd0689aad53e974095f78dc27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0590.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0590","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c6db79ec54738aa67e7f26ae3b03fbb6f3301176/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0590.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8ac1704ec258f0ded20dc2e1c602afda5159d6d8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0590.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a296135b4fb6684177b1ef84e538a96d91a93adb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p3qf-8c2m-c92q/GHSA-p3qf-8c2m-c92q.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/f12bc26bc9e16bb03717da47ceb3a7cd51c32005/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0590.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/pollit.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0590.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0469.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0469.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0469.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0660","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0660.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0566","title":"Linux man 软件包 makewhatis 本地符号链接文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Linux man 软件包中的 makewhatis 工具存在不安全临时文件处理漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建符号链接攻击（symlink attack），在 makewhatis 运行时将其临时文件指向目标系统文件，从而覆盖任意系统文件。该漏洞影响 Linux man 软件包多个版本，攻击者需要拥有本地账号权限，利用条件为诱使 makewhatis 执行并利用 /tmp 目录下的符号链接指向敏感文件，可实现本地提权或破坏系统文件完整性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0566"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-07-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00.680","remediation":"升级 Linux man 软件包到 1.5i 或更新版本，该版本已改用 mkstemp() 安全创建临时文件，避免可预测路径。如系统使用 man-db（替代 man），确保升级到最新版本即可，man-db 默认使用安全的临时文件机制。无法升级时，确保 /tmp 目录设置了粘滞位 (Sticky Bit)，限制普通用户对临时目录的写删除权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0390.html","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2000:015","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-041.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1434","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4900","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0566.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0566","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0566.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0566.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-r9xr-g4pq-h8rv/GHSA-r9xr-g4pq-h8rv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b25ab97e-27c5-4bec-bb43-068df4beceb6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0566.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a3d797a054f33a26fc99648a4e1cc47b2bce8d08/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0660.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0464","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0464.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0584","title":"Canna 输入系统远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Canna 日文输入系统（cannaserver）的 SR_INIT 命令在处理用户名或组名参数时存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过向目标主机的 5680 端口发送携带超长用户名或组名的 SR_INIT 数据包触发溢出，覆盖栈上的返回地址并执行任意代码，从而获得与 cannaserver 进程相同权限的远程 shell。该漏洞影响 Canna 3.5 b2 及更早版本，广泛存在于搭载该软件的 Linux、FreeBSD 等 Unix 类操作系统中，CVSS v2 评分满分 10.0，危害等级为严重。修复方式为升级 Canna 至安全版本或限制 cannaserver 服务仅监听本地地址。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0584"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-02T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03.060","remediation":"升级 Canna 至 3.2.2 或更高版本以修复 SR_INIT 命令中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。FreeBSD 系统可升级 ports 集合并重新编译 Canna 端口，或下载 ja-Canna-3.2.2 软件包替换旧版本；Linux 及其他系统应替换为厂商发布的安全补丁版本。临时缓解措施：创建 /etc/hosts.canna 文件并写入仅允许访问 Canna 服务器的主机列表（如 localhost 和 unix），限制远程访问范围；或通过防火墙规则阻断对 Canna 服务端口 5680 的入站连接；亦可直接停用 cannaserver 服务以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://shadowpenguin.backsection.net/advisories/advisory038.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1445","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4912","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20061","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1781cc6a314747dfce9d8864a3f090ef8f0a6f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0584.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0584","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0584/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/21f29c262df67f8fba785d468c4552b0e1fc4211/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0584.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/aa5f2f0cb1791a7f76244bf9f9a0c7e17c4a2f8d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0584.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-756c-jfq2-c688/GHSA-756c-jfq2-c688.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/canna_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0584.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--760c5c7f-6553-4451-9098-16672c296960.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0464.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0683","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0683.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0583","title":"Inter7 vpopmail Syslog 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Inter7 vpopmail vchkpw 程序在 4.8 版本前存在格式化字符串漏洞，vchkpw 程序在调用 syslog 时未正确清洗不可信的格式化字符串，远程攻击者可通过发送包含任意格式化指令的 USER 或 PASS 命令触发该漏洞，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Inter7 vpopmail 4.5 和 4.7 版本（4.8 之前版本），CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于网络可访问、低攻击复杂度、无需认证、部分可用性影响的拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可远程发送包含格式化字符串指令（如 %n、%s 等）的 USER 或 PASS 命令，导致 vchkpw 进程崩溃或异常行为，造成邮件服务拒绝服务。升级至 vpopmail 4.8 或更高版本可修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0583"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02.937","remediation":"建议立即升级 vpopmail 至 4.8 或更高版本（官方已修复该格式化字符串漏洞）。若无法立即升级，可通过 TCP Wrappers 或防火墙限制 vchkpw 服务仅允许受信 IP 访问，并在 syslog 配置中禁用 vchkpw 的格式化字符串日志记录功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1418","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=395BD2A8.5D3396A7%40secureaustin.com","http://www.vpopmail.cx/vpopmail-ChangeLog","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0583.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0583","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0583.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0583.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2ffp-463q-9cmj/GHSA-2ffp-463q-9cmj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0583.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0583.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/vpop_input_validation.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0683.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0662","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0662.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0568","title":"Sybergen Secure Desktop 2.1 ICMP 路由通告欺骗漏洞","description":"Sybergen Secure Desktop 2.1 存在 ICMP 路由通告 (ICMP 类型 9) 验证缺陷，未正确防护伪造的路由器通告报文。远程攻击者可向目标主机发送伪造的 ICMP 路由器通告报文，篡改目标系统的默认路由表，导致流量被劫持或重定向，造成拒绝服务（可用性影响）。该漏洞影响 Sybergen Secure Desktop 2.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P)，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，仅影响可用性。攻击者只需发送伪造的 ICMP Type 9 数据包即可篡改目标主机默认路由，实现流量劫持或拒绝服务攻击。Sybergen 已停止对该产品的支持，用户应升级至支持的安全产品或配置防火墙过滤 ICMP Type 9 报文。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0568"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00.940","remediation":"立即更新 Sybergen Secure Desktop 到最新支持版本，并关闭或过滤 ICMP 类型 9 的路由通告功能作为首要措施。如无法更新软件，可在网络设备上部署 STP 协议并配置静态路由以防止路由劫持。如需保留兼容性，可启用 ICMP 通告速率限制并验证所有路由来源的路由器 ID。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1417","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=4125690E.00524395.00%40guardianit.se","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0568.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0568","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0568.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0568.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9c8x-vv79-pccg/GHSA-9c8x-vv79-pccg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0568.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/72eb3babf4053f474a6fa1578cb387378535ac53/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0568.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0662.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0463","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0463.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0582","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 4.0/4.1 服务拒绝漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 4.0/4.1 的 SMTP Security Server 代理在处理无效命令流（如二进制零流）时存在资源耗尽漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过向 SMTP 代理端口发送持续的无效命令流触发资源耗尽，导致防火墙 SMTP 代理服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 4.0 和 4.1 版本，CVSS 5.0 分（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，仅影响可用性。攻击者可通过发送持续的二进制零或其他无效 SMTP 命令流耗尽代理资源，导致合法邮件服务中断。Check Point 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0582"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02.813","remediation":"建议立即升级 Check Point FireWall-1 至 4.1 SP2 或更高版本（含 Hotfix HFA-01），或升级至 NG 版本。若无法立即升级，可在防火墙策略中禁用 SMTP Security Server 代理功能，或在边界防火墙配置 ACL 限制仅允许受信 SMTP 服务器访问 25 端口，同时在 SMTP 代理前部署流量清洗设备限制异常命令流量。建议参考 Check Point 官方安全公告 SK31241 获取对应版本热修复包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/alerts/list_vun.html#SMTP_Security","http://www.osvdb.org/1438","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1416","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.1000630162106.4619C-100000%40fjord.fscinternet.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20049","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0582.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0582","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0582.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0582.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pvc7-5x99-c9mm/GHSA-pvc7-5x99-c9mm.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0582.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0582.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0463.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0462","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0462.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0581","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Telnet 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过向目标 Telnet 服务持续发送二进制零字节流触发该漏洞，导致 Telnet 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Windows 2000 操作系统的 Telnet 服务组件，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击复杂度低、无需身份认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者只需具备网络访问权限，即可通过发送持续的二进制零数据流触发服务崩溃，导致合法用户无法使用 Telnet 服务。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议升级至修补版本或禁用不必要的 Telnet 服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0581"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02.687","remediation":"升级到包含 Telnet 服务修复程序的 Windows 2000 SP4 或更高版本；关闭或禁用 Telnet 服务；在防火墙上限制 Telnet 端口（端口 23）访问；配置 Windows 2000 阻止零字节序列或实现包过滤以过滤异常流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1414","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.1000630161841.4619A-100000%40fjord.fscinternet.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20047","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0581.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0581","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0581.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0581.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gh92-r6m8-gq4c/GHSA-gh92-r6m8-gq4c.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0581.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1414/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0581.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0462.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0461","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0461.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0580","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 端口泛洪拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 2000 Server 存在端口洪水拒绝服务漏洞，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可向目标系统的多个 TCP 和 UDP 端口持续发送二进制零数据流，导致系统 CPU 占用率异常飙升，耗尽 CPU 资源并导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 Server 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程发起攻击，攻击复杂度低，仅影响系统可用性（CVSS 5.0，AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P）。攻击者可利用现有 PoC（如 ExploitDB-20048）向目标端口持续发送空字节流触发漏洞，导致系统响应缓慢或完全无响应。Microsoft 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或配置防火墙限制非必要端口访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0580"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02.560","remediation":"安装 Windows 2000 SP4 及更高版本，在注册表中启用网络洪水保护（HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\Tcpip\\Parameters 的 \"EnableIPOptions\" 为 0），同时在防火墙上配置端口限制和流量过滤规则，例如限制单位时间内对每个端口的 SYN 请求数，并部署硬件级网络入侵检测系统以阻止恶意 ICMP 流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1415","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.1000630161935.4619B-100000%40fjord.fscinternet.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20048","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0580.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0580.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0580","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0580.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0580.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v3p7-33wf-f77j/GHSA-v3p7-33wf-f77j.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0580.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1415/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0461.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0451","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0451.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0569","title":"Sybergen Sygate DNS 数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sybergen Sygate 2.0/3.11 网络安全软件存在协议处理缺陷，攻击者可构造恶意 DNS UDP 报文发送至目标系统内部接口。该漏洞源于该软件对 DNS 协议报文合法性验证不足，当接收到包含特殊结构或超长数据的 UDP 包时，会导致核心网络处理模块出现严重资源耗尽或崩溃。受影响产品涵盖 Sygate 2.0 和 3.11 所有版本，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，一旦成功利用，将导致系统网络服务完全不可用，用户无法正常访问网络资源，甚至可能引发服务长时间中断。该攻击过程相对简单，攻击者仅需编制包含畸形 DNS 标头和异常长度数据的 UDP 报文，并将其发送到 Sygate 监听的内部网络接口即可，系统会因缓冲区溢出或其他资源分配错误而出现宕机，攻击者无需执行任何代码，但能造成严重的服务毁坏后果。因此，该漏洞对基于 Sygate 进行网络防护的组织构成严重威胁。官方安全公告已详细记录这一问题，建议立即更新到最新版本或采取手动修复措施，以缓解该安全风险。相关漏洞报告于 2000 年 6 月发布，编号 CVE-2000-0569， CVSS 评分 5.0，反映其中等严重性，但实际影响可能因具体网络环境和 Sygate 配置而异。参考 ExploitDB 公开的攻击样本 20051 进一步证实了这一漏洞的可利用性。属 network_service 漏洞类型。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0569"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:01.067","remediation":"建议立即升级 Sybergen Sygate 至 4.0 及以上版本（Symantec 收购后发布的版本），或在防火墙/路由器层面配置规则丢弃发往内部接口 UDP 53 端口的异常 DNS 数据包（如异常标志位、异常长度），并限制内部接口仅允许受信任 DNS 服务器 IP 访问 UDP 53 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q2/0189.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1420","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5049","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20051","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0569.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0569","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0569.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0569.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v2g6-64p5-pq6w/GHSA-v2g6-64p5-pq6w.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0569.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0569.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7e0b5ee7-4859-4c76-93c9-22024dc54fae.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0451.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0737","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0737.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0612","title":"Microsoft Windows 9x/NT 4.0 ARP欺骗漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95、Windows 98 和 Windows NT 4.0 的 ARP 协议实现存在缺陷，未正确验证接收到的 ARP 数据包来源真实性。远程未认证攻击者可向目标主机发送伪造的 ARP 回复包，覆盖系统 ARP 缓存表中的静态条目，导致 ARP 缓存投毒。攻击者可利用此漏洞实施中间人攻击、流量劫持或会话劫持，破坏网络通信完整性。该漏洞影响 Windows 95、98 及 NT 4.0 系统，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响完整性。Microsoft 已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或配置静态 ARP 条目防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0612"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-29T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06.560","remediation":"Windows 95、Windows 98 及 Windows NT 4.0 目前均已停止支持，Microsoft 未针对此漏洞发布专门补丁，建议通过以下方式修复：将受影响的系统升级至受支持的 Microsoft Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019/2022 及以上版本）；在现有受支持系统上启用动态 ARP 检测（DAI, Dynamic ARP Inspection）功能以阻止伪造 ARP 报文；在交换机和路由器上启用端口安全（Port Security）特性，将每个端口的 MAC 地址数量限制为合法主机数量；在网络边界防火墙和路由器上配置静态 ARP 条目绑定关键网关和服务器 IP 与 MAC 地址映射，防止 ARP 缓存表被篡改；对跨 VLAN 通信启用严格的 ACL 访问控制，限制仅允许必要的 ARP 流量通过；在网关上启用 ARP 报文来源验证功能，丢弃外部到达的 ARP 回复报文。对于无法立即升级的 Windows NT 4.0 核心服务器，应在物理网络层面实施 VLAN 隔离和端口绑定，并通过静态 ARP 绑定网关 MAC 地址作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1406","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=395B7E64.9FB3D4DB%40starzetz.de","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0612.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0612","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0612.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0612.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6h3c-53gf-6qc3/GHSA-6h3c-53gf-6qc3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0612.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1406/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0612.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0737.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0707","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0707.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0599","title":"iMesh imesh 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"iMesh 1.02 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于对 iMesh 端口接收的数据长度缺乏边界检查，远程未认证攻击者可向目标端口发送超长字符串触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖返回地址实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 iMesh 1.02 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络远程、攻击复杂度低、无需认证即可触发，成功利用可导致目标系统机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。攻击者仅需向目标主机的 iMesh 服务端口发送精心构造的超长数据包即可触发漏洞，无需用户交互即可实现远程代码执行。官方已停止维护，建议停用该软件或升级到修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0599"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-29T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05.000","remediation":"建议立即卸载 iMesh 1.02 及更早版本，该软件已长期停止维护且无官方补丁。如无法卸载，请在防火墙层面封锁 iMesh 服务端口（默认 TCP 端口），并禁用该应用程序的网络访问权限作为临时缓解措施。建议迁移至现代、仍在维护的 P2P 客户端或合法流媒体服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0335.html","http://www.imesh.com/download/download.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1407","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0599.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0599","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0599.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0599.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fc9j-q76r-j649/GHSA-fc9j-q76r-j649.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0599.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0707.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0465","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0465.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0586","title":"DALnet Bahamut IRCd SUMMON 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"DALnet Bahamut IRCd 4.6.5 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过发送特制的 SUMMON 命令触发该漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞导致拒绝服务或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 Bahamut IRCd 4.6.5 版本的 IRC 服务器，CVSS 评分为 10，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0586"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-29T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:03.320","remediation":"升级到 DALnet Bahamut IRCd 4.6.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SUMMON 命令的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可禁用 IRCd 的 SUMMON 命令功能，或在防火墙层面阻止外部对 IRC 服务端口（默认 6667）的 TCP 访问以临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q2/1092.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1404","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20043","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b07067ca91b3ffc85e0e1474c6067f8e36d784cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0586.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0586","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0586/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/74c23eb8cb898db2cae5ec3230c8e7deb48423c4/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0586.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8109cc9beabe213e111588d9156148e0cfb893b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0586.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f54q-8494-3hvh/GHSA-f54q-8494-3hvh.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0586.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0465.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0465.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0465.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1309","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0597","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.01, Excel 2000, PowerPoint 2000 ActiveX 对象执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 2000 (Excel 和 PowerPoint) 及 PowerPoint 97 的 ActiveX 控件被错误标记为\"安全供脚本使用\", 导致远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页或 HTML 邮件, 诱使用户在 Internet Explorer 或 Outlook 等邮件客户端中打开, 利用 VBA SaveAs 函数强制将任意文件保存到目标系统任意路径, 实现任意文件写入。该漏洞影响安装了 Office 2000 或 PowerPoint 97 的 Windows 系统, 攻击者只需诱导用户访问恶意页面或打开恶意邮件即可触发, 无需用户交互即可实现任意文件写入, 进而可能植入恶意脚本、启动项或覆盖系统文件实现代码执行。CVSS 7.5 分, 影响范围广泛, 微软已发布补丁修复。Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS00-043 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0597"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-27T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:04.747","remediation":"立即升级到 Microsoft Office 2003 或更高版本（建议升级至 Office 2016/2019/365），并将 Internet Explorer 升级至 IE 6 或更高版本（建议迁移至 Microsoft Edge）。若无法立即升级，请立即应用微软安全公告 MS00-043（KB268744）提供的 Office 2000 安全补丁包，并在注册表 HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Office\\11.0\\Excel\\Security 中设置 VBAWarnings=2 禁用 VBA 宏，或通过组策略禁用 ActiveX 控件运行、限制 VBA SaveAs 方法权限，同时在网络边界部署入侵防御系统阻断恶意 HTML 页面投递。若仍需使用 Office 2000，建议隔离至离线环境并禁用 Outlook/IE 的 HTML 邮件渲染功能作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1399","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=39589349.ED9DBCAB%40nat.bg","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-049","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2a4c15d247e2aa1e32bb9712f81631be3a25fb82/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0597.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0597","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0597.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0597.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m2cw-8f75-qf8v/GHSA-m2cw-8f75-qf8v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0597.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0597.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1fa00789-ff4f-4399-9a7b-3a41bd9e31c5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1309.toml"}]